menuconfig ZMK_BLE_DFU
    bool "ZMK BLE DFU bootloader behavior"
    depends on REBOOT
    help
      Enable the &ble_dfu behavior. Pressing the behavior reboots a compatible
      Adafruit nRF52 Bootloader into its Bluetooth OTA DFU mode.

